{{define "content"}}
<div class="head"><div class="titles"><h1>Spike VMs</h1><div class="sub"><span>{{term "spike-vm" "VMs that agents started"}} through a vm runner service. They have no network; agents drive them with screenshots, input and the guest agent.</span></div></div></div>
